items.flock4h.axos_healing_book.name = Axo's Healing Book
items.flock4h.axos_healing_book.description = LMB fires a Healing Bolt that fully heals what it hits. RMB heals you at a mana cost.
items.flock4h.axos_immunity_book.name = Axo's Immunity Book
items.flock4h.axos_immunity_book.description = RMB grants brief damage immunity at a mana cost.
items.flock4h.axos_horde_book.name = Axo's Horde Book
items.flock4h.axos_horde_book.description = RMB summons a short-lived brute horde to fight for you at a mana cost.
items.flock4h.axos_doom_book.name = Axo's Book of Doom
items.flock4h.axos_doom_book.description = RMB hurls a Doom Ball that deals heavy damage at a mana cost.
items.flock4h.axos_mining_spellbook.name = Axo's Mining Book
items.flock4h.axos_mining_spellbook.description = RMB mines a patch of blocks where you aim at a mana cost.
items.flock4h.axos_teleport_book.name = Axo's Teleport Book
items.flock4h.axos_teleport_book.description = RMB teleports you to the block you are looking at; costs mana.
items.flock4h.axos_taunt_book.name = Axo's Taunt Book
items.flock4h.axos_taunt_book.description = RMB launches you upward and slams on landing for area damage at a mana cost.
items.flock4h.axos_morph_book.name = Axo's Morph Book
items.flock4h.axos_morph_book.description = RMB fires a Morph Vortex to steal a target's form at a mana cost. LMB restores your true form.
items.flock4h.axos_frost_book.name = Axo's Frost Book
items.flock4h.axos_frost_book.description = RMB launches a Frost Shard that slows foes and turns terrain to snow brick at a mana cost.
items.flock4h.axos_flame_book.name = Axo's Flame Book
items.flock4h.axos_flame_book.description = RMB launches a Flame Bolt that burns foes and turns terrain to volcanic rock at a mana cost.
items.flock4h.axos_ancient_sword.name = Axo's Ancient Sword
items.flock4h.axos_ancient_sword.description = A mana-fed blade with a sky-blue trail. RMB casts an Ancient Slash at a mana cost; carrying it increases max mana.
items.flock4h.empty_potion_bottle.name = Axo's Empty Potion Bottle
items.flock4h.empty_potion_bottle.description = A throwable empty bottle used as the base for brewing Axo Tales potions.
items.flock4h.curse_potion.name = Curse Potion
items.flock4h.curse_potion.description = A thrown splash vial that explodes in cursed damage.
items.flock4h.invisibility_potion.name = Invisibility Potion
items.flock4h.invisibility_potion.description = Drink to fade from other players for a short time.
items.flock4h.strength_potion.name = Strength Potion
items.flock4h.strength_potion.description = Drink to double your outgoing damage for a short time.
items.flock4h.rabbit_potion.name = Rabbit Potion
items.flock4h.rabbit_potion.description = Drink to leap higher for a short time.
items.flock4h.swift_potion.name = Swift Potion
items.flock4h.swift_potion.description = Drink to move faster for a short time.
items.flock4h.kudu_boots.name = Kudu Boots
items.flock4h.kudu_boots.description = While worn, turns water beneath you into snow brick so you can walk across. Also increases max mana.
